WEBVTT

00:20:30.371 --> 00:20:33.163
You know, Kodak was the industry
leader in photography.

00:20:33.746 --> 00:20:36.246
They pioneered research into
the digital camera,

00:20:36.913 --> 00:20:41.204
but then they shelved it and escalated
their commitment to film.

00:20:44.413 --> 00:20:48.996
Bad decisions and then the decision to
stick with them don't happen in a vacuum.

00:20:49.829 --> 00:20:51.079
The culture and structure of

00:20:51.079 --> 00:20:54.538
an organization can propel us straight
into escalation of commitment.

00:20:55.329 --> 00:20:58.996
But research shows there are tangible
steps organizations can take to protect

00:20:58.996 --> 00:21:02.788
us to make it easier to take a clear
eyed look at the course we're on